Controlled acceptance of T-076-2's first complete production slice. The
fixture supplies reviewer JSON as an external actor, never as a gate result.
Each negative has valid surrounding identities and a single deliberate
violation. Real read-only sandbox behavior remains the separately approved
P-review probe.

